      "body": "This code was originally [added](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/13886) to make `runCommand` handle UTF-8 command strings. Since https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/32380, the active code page is guaranteed to be UTF-8, so the narrow `::system()` accepts UTF-8 directly and the wide conversion is no longer needed. Therefore, the correct solution here is to revert 23db9546c16c2be264cfc4f695f5738a2f5beeeb",
